n additional level of the Range Up... upgrade and added the first upgrade for the Goose Slayer.Gameplay ImprovementsIncreased initial spawn rate of goosesSome gooses now have adjusted health valuesFroligoose and Fatgoo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:10:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114034419","verified_at":"2026-10-23T03:30:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854540-1846651706688358","game_id":"steam-4854540","kind":"update","title":"Steam Next Fest Update!","summary":"Honk honk! We've prepared an update in celebration of Steam Next Fest! Thank you to everyone for sluicing our gooses! This update adds new content, expands the Legendary Goose event, and brings a round of visual and gameplay improvements.New ContentGoose Chipper: A new weapon that grows while you hold still, then bounces around the farm. It also includes a fancy hidden visual bonus as well!Golden Goose upgrade: Gives each goose a chance to appear as a golden variant with increased drops and pass","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T00:12:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688358","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:02:57Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4854540-1842846814441739","game_id":"steam-4854540","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO NOW AVAILABLE!","summary":"Get ready to sluice those gooses! The demo is now officially live! Steam Next Fest is also right around the corner so be honkin ready for a demo update when that rolls around as well! *my graphic designer is on UPTO (unpaid time off) so here's a goose","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T23:25:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalp